---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const sections = [
	{
		id: "preamble",
		number: "01",
		title: "Preamble",
		subtitle: "Why transformers changed everything",
	},
	{
		id: "architecture",
		number: "02",
		title: "Architecture Overview",
		subtitle: "The full picture, from input to output",
	},
	{
		id: "embeddings",
		number: "03",
		title: "Embeddings",
		subtitle: "Turning words into numbers",
	},
	{
		id: "attention",
		number: "04",
		title: "Attention",
		subtitle: "The mechanism that lets tokens talk to each other",
	},
	{
		id: "multi-head-attention",
		number: "05",
		title: "Multi-Head Attention",
		subtitle: "Many perspectives, one representation",
	},
	{
		id: "ffn",
		number: "06",
		title: "Feed-Forward Network",
		subtitle: "Per-token computation and memory",
	},
	{
		id: "residual-stream",
		number: "07",
		title: "Residual Stream",
		subtitle: "The information highway through the network",
	},
	{
		id: "output",
		number: "08",
		title: "Output",
		subtitle: "From vectors back to words",
	},
	{
		id: "circuits",
		number: "09",
		title: "Circuits",
		subtitle: "How attention heads compose into algorithms",
	},
];
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "How Transformers Work" }}>
	{/* Hero — full width, above the three-column layout */}
	<header class="hero mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 pt-8 text-center sm:px-6 sm:pt-16">
		<p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">
			Interactive Explainer
		</p>
		<h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-accent-2 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
			How Transformers Work
		</h1>
		<p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-textColor/80 sm:text-xl">
			A visual, interactive guide to the architecture behind modern AI — from
			tokens to predictions, attention to circuits.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm text-textColor/50">
			<span>Toby Lunt</span>
			<span class="text-accent/40">|</span>
			<span>2026</span>
			<span class="text-accent/40">|</span>
			<span>~30 min read</span>
		</div>
		<div class="mx-auto mt-12 h-px w-24 bg-accent/30"></div>
	</header>

	{/* Three-column body: TOC | Content | Sidenotes */}
	<div class="transformers-layout">
		{/* Left TOC sidebar — desktop only */}
		<nav id="toc-sidebar" class="toc-sidebar" aria-label="Table of contents">
			<div class="toc-inner">
				<ul class="toc-list">
					{
						sections.map((section) => (
							<li>
								<a
									href={`#${section.id}`}
									class="toc-dot-link"
									data-section={section.id}
									aria-label={section.title}
								>
									<span class="toc-dot"></span>
									<span class="toc-label">{section.number} {section.title}</span>
								</a>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</nav>

		{/* Main content column */}
		<article class="transformers-content">

			{/* ===== Section 01: Preamble ===== */}
			<section id="preamble" class="mb-24 scroll-mt-20">
				<div class="mb-8 flex items-baseline gap-4">
					<span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent/60">01</span>
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-accent-2 sm:text-3xl">Preamble</h2>
						<p class="mt-1 text-base text-textColor/60">Why transformers changed everything</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				{/* Introductory prose */}
				<div class="preamble-prose">
					<p>
						In 2017, a team at Google published a paper with an unassuming title:
						<em>"Attention Is All You Need."</em> It introduced the <strong>transformer</strong> — an
						architecture that would go on to power GPT, BERT, Claude, Stable Diffusion,
						AlphaFold, and nearly every major AI breakthrough since.
					</p>
					<p>
						Before transformers, sequence models processed tokens one at a time.
						Recurrent neural networks (RNNs) and their variants — LSTMs and GRUs —
						passed a hidden state forward step by step, like reading a book one word
						at a time and trying to remember the whole plot through a single bottleneck of memory.
					</p>
					<p>
						This sequential constraint meant two things: training was slow (you couldn't
						parallelize), and long-range dependencies were hard to capture. By the time
						the model reached the end of a long paragraph, the beginning had faded.
					</p>
					<p>
						The transformer's key insight was radical: <strong>throw away recurrence entirely.</strong>
						Instead, let every token attend to every other token simultaneously. This
						mechanism — <em>self-attention</em> — lets the model look at the entire input at
						once, deciding which parts matter for each part.
					</p>
				</div>

				{/* Timeline: RNNs → LSTMs → Attention → Transformers */}
				<div class="preamble-timeline" aria-label="Evolution from RNNs to Transformers">
					<div class="timeline-track"></div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot-past"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<span class="timeline-year">~2014</span>
							<span class="timeline-label">RNNs &amp; LSTMs</span>
							<span class="timeline-desc">Sequential processing, one token at a time</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot-past"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<span class="timeline-year">2015</span>
							<span class="timeline-label">Attention (Bahdanau)</span>
							<span class="timeline-desc">Learned to focus on relevant input positions</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot-present"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<span class="timeline-year">2017</span>
							<span class="timeline-label">Transformer</span>
							<span class="timeline-desc">Attention is all you need — no recurrence</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot-future"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<span class="timeline-year">2018+</span>
							<span class="timeline-label">GPT, BERT, and beyond</span>
							<span class="timeline-desc">Scaling transforms everything</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				{/* Visual vocabulary — component color legend */}
				<div class="preamble-vocab">
					<p class="vocab-intro">
						Throughout this explainer, we'll use a consistent visual language.
						Each major component has its own color, so you'll always know what you're looking at:
					</p>
					<div class="vocab-grid">
						<div class="vocab-item">
							<div class="vocab-swatch vocab-embedding"></div>
							<div class="vocab-meta">
								<span class="vocab-name">Embedding</span>
								<span class="vocab-hint">Words &rarr; vectors</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="vocab-item">
							<div class="vocab-swatch vocab-attention"></div>
							<div class="vocab-meta">
								<span class="vocab-name">Attention</span>
								<span class="vocab-hint">Tokens talk to each other</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="vocab-item">
							<div class="vocab-swatch vocab-ffn"></div>
							<div class="vocab-meta">
								<span class="vocab-name">Feed-Forward</span>
								<span class="vocab-hint">Per-token computation</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="vocab-item">
							<div class="vocab-swatch vocab-residual"></div>
							<div class="vocab-meta">
								<span class="vocab-name">Residual Stream</span>
								<span class="vocab-hint">The information highway</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="vocab-item">
							<div class="vocab-swatch vocab-output"></div>
							<div class="vocab-meta">
								<span class="vocab-name">Output</span>
								<span class="vocab-hint">Vectors &rarr; words</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				{/* Black box teaser */}
				<div class="preamble-teaser">
					<div class="teaser-box">
						<div class="teaser-label-in">tokens in</div>
						<div class="teaser-blackbox">
							<span class="teaser-q">?</span>
						</div>
						<div class="teaser-label-out">prediction out</div>
					</div>
					<p class="teaser-text">
						Right now, the transformer is a black box. Tokens go in, a prediction comes out.
						Over the next eight sections, we'll open this box — layer by layer, mechanism
						by mechanism — until there's nothing left to hide.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* ===== Sections 02–09: Placeholders ===== */}
			{
				sections.filter(s => s.id !== 'preamble').map((section) => (
					<section
						id={section.id}
						class="section-placeholder mb-24 scroll-mt-20"
					>
						<div class="mb-8 flex items-baseline gap-4">
							<span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent/60">
								{section.number}
							</span>
							<div>
								<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-accent-2 sm:text-3xl">
									{section.title}
								</h2>
								<p class="mt-1 text-base text-textColor/60">
									{section.subtitle}
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-textColor/15 bg-bgColor/50 px-6 py-16 text-center">
							<div class="mb-3 text-3xl text-textColor/20">&#9671;</div>
							<p class="text-sm text-textColor/40">
								Interactive content coming soon
							</p>
						</div>
					</section>
				))
			}
		</article>

		{/* Right sidenote gutter — desktop only, content added by future features */}
		<aside class="sidenote-gutter" aria-label="Sidenotes">
		</aside>
	</div>

	{/* Mobile TOC — floating button + bottom-sheet drawer */}
	<button
		id="mobile-toc-toggle"
		class="mobile-toc-toggle"
		aria-label="Table of contents"
		aria-expanded="false"
	>
		<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
			<rect x="2" y="3" width="14" height="1.5" rx="0.75" fill="currentColor"/>
			<rect x="2" y="8.25" width="10" height="1.5" rx="0.75" fill="currentColor"/>
			<rect x="2" y="13.5" width="6" height="1.5" rx="0.75" fill="currentColor"/>
		</svg>
	</button>
	<div id="mobile-toc-backdrop" class="mobile-toc-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div id="mobile-toc-drawer" class="mobile-toc-drawer" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="mobile-toc-header">
			<span class="mobile-toc-title">Contents</span>
			<button id="mobile-toc-close" class="mobile-toc-close" aria-label="Close table of contents">
				<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
					<path d="M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
				</svg>
			</button>
		</div>
		<ul class="mobile-toc-list">
			{
				sections.map((section) => (
					<li>
						<a href={`#${section.id}`} class="mobile-toc-link" data-section={section.id}>
							<span class="mobile-toc-number">{section.number}</span>
							{section.title}
						</a>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
	/* ===== Break out of Base layout's max-w-3xl body constraint ===== */
	.hero {
		width: 100vw;
		position: relative;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	.transformers-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		/* Break out of body max-width */
		width: 100vw;
		position: relative;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		padding: 0 1rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.transformers-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr) 200px;
			gap: 0 2rem;
			padding: 0 3rem;
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1536px) {
		.transformers-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr) 240px;
			gap: 0 2.5rem;
			padding: 0 4rem;
		}
	}

	/* ===== Main content column ===== */
	.transformers-content {
		grid-column: 1;
		padding: 0 0 2rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.transformers-content {
			grid-column: 2;
		}
	}

	/* ===== Left TOC sidebar ===== */
	.toc-sidebar {
		display: none;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.toc-sidebar {
			display: block;
			grid-column: 1;
			grid-row: 1;
		}
	}

	.toc-inner {
		position: sticky;
		top: 5rem;
	}

	.toc-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
		/* Vertical line behind dots — centered on the dot column */
		position: relative;
	}

	.toc-list::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 4px; /* center of 9px dot area */
		top: 14px; /* vertically center between first and last dot */
		bottom: 14px;
		width: 1.5px;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.1);
		border-radius: 1px;
	}

	.toc-dot-link {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		padding: 7px 0;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.toc-dot-link:hover {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.55);
	}

	/* Read state: sections above current */
	.toc-dot-link.read {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.35);
	}

	/* Active state: current section */
	.toc-dot-link.active {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.85);
	}

	.toc-dot {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 9px;
		height: 9px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-bg) / 1);
		border: 1.5px solid hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.18);
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		transition: background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
	}

	/* Read dots: small filled, muted */
	.toc-dot-link.read .toc-dot {
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		border-color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		transform: scale(0.7);
	}

	/* Active dot: filled accent, larger */
	.toc-dot-link.active .toc-dot {
		background: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 1);
		border-color: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 1);
		transform: scale(1.1);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 0.15);
	}

	/* Hover unread dots */
	.toc-dot-link:hover .toc-dot {
		border-color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.35);
	}

	.toc-label {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
		white-space: nowrap;
		overflow: hidden;
		text-overflow: ellipsis;
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateX(-4px);
		transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
	}

	.toc-dot-link.active .toc-label {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateX(0);
		color: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 1);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.toc-sidebar:hover .toc-label {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateX(0);
	}

	/* ===== Right sidenote gutter ===== */
	.sidenote-gutter {
		display: none;
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.sidenote-gutter {
			display: block;
			grid-column: 3;
			grid-row: 1;
		}
	}

	/* ===== Mobile TOC toggle button ===== */
	.mobile-toc-toggle {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		position: fixed;
		bottom: 1.25rem;
		left: 1.25rem;
		z-index: 40;
		width: 44px;
		height: 44px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 1px solid hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.12);
		background: hsl(var(--theme-bg) / 0.92);
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.6);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		box-shadow: 0 2px 12px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
	}

	.mobile-toc-toggle:hover {
		transform: scale(1.06);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 16px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.16);
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.mobile-toc-toggle {
			display: none;
		}
	}

	/* ===== Mobile TOC backdrop ===== */
	.mobile-toc-backdrop {
		display: none;
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 49;
		background: hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.35);
	}

	.mobile-toc-backdrop.open {
		display: block;
		animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease forwards;
	}

	/* ===== Mobile TOC drawer (bottom sheet) ===== */
	.mobile-toc-drawer {
		position: fixed;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		z-index: 50;
		max-height: 65vh;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-bg) / 0.98);
		border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.08);
		border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
		backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		box-shadow: 0 -4px 24px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.12);
		transform: translateY(100%);
		transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
		overflow-y: auto;
		overscroll-behavior: contain;
	}

	.mobile-toc-drawer.open {
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.mobile-toc-drawer,
		.mobile-toc-backdrop {
			display: none !important;
		}
	}

	.mobile-toc-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding: 14px 20px 6px;
		position: sticky;
		top: 0;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-bg) / 0.98);
		backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
	}

	.mobile-toc-title {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.4);
	}

	.mobile-toc-close {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 30px;
		height: 30px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: none;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.06);
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.45);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.15s ease;
	}

	.mobile-toc-close:hover {
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.12);
	}

	.mobile-toc-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 4px 12px 28px;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.mobile-toc-link {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 10px 10px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.55);
		transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.mobile-toc-link:hover {
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.04);
	}

	.mobile-toc-link.active {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 1);
		background: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 0.07);
	}

	.mobile-toc-number {
		font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.25);
		min-width: 1.5em;
	}

	.mobile-toc-link.active .mobile-toc-number {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-accent) / 0.55);
	}

	@keyframes fadeIn {
		from { opacity: 0; }
		to { opacity: 1; }
	}

	/* ===== Preamble prose ===== */
	.preamble-prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.preamble-prose p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.78);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.preamble-prose em {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.9);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.preamble-prose strong {
		color: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.95);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* ===== Timeline ===== */
	.preamble-timeline {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
		padding: 2.5rem 0 2rem 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.timeline-track {
		position: absolute;
		left: 7px;
		top: 2.5rem;
		bottom: 2rem;
		width: 2px;
		background: hsl(var(--theme-text) / 0.08);
		border-radius: 1px;
	}

	.timeline-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 0;
		position: relative;
	}

	.timeline-dot {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 2px solid;
		position: relative;
		left: -1.5rem;
		margin-right: -1.5rem;
